    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_20061229.0164\n\nDURBAN, South Africa, Dec 29 , 2006, 2006\n\nIndia set to make 354 to win\n\n\n\n\nIndia were set a target of 354 to win when South Africa declared their second innings at 265 for eight on the fourth day of the second Test at Kingsmead Friday.\n\nShaun Pollock made a stroke-filled 63 not out as South Africa pushed for quick runs after lunch. Shanthakumuran Sreesanth was India's most successful bowler with four for 79.\n\nThere were 48 overs due to be bowled on the fourth day.",
